%% Render: ~/.zcode/tools/mermaid-render/render.sh -i one-copied-trade.mmd -o ../images/one-copied-trade.png -b white -s 2 -w 1600
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Leader wallet
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as Solana RPC
    participant J as Jupiter
    participant D as Dashboard

    L-->>R: a buy lands on chain
    W->>R: poll the roster wallet, every 45 seconds
    R-->>W: the transaction
    Note over W: classify and dedupe, drop events older than 90 seconds,<br/>coalesce same-mint buys inside 60 seconds,<br/>size at a quarter of the measured input, floored and capped
    W->>W: risk gates: deployed share, daily loss, price age,<br/>slippage, price impact
    W->>J: request a quote
    J-->>W: price and route
    alt paper mode
        W->>W: simulate the fill
    else live and armed
        W->>W: sign, submit, confirm
    end
    W->>D: position, fill, equity

    L-->>R: a sell lands on chain
    W->>R: poll
    R-->>W: the sell
    Note over W: mirror the same fraction
    W->>D: close, PnL, loss streak

    Note over W,D: a position still open at 8 hours exits on its own<br/>3 hours of grace apply while the mark is not positive
